## What It Is

GatherPack is free, open-source group management software for teams, clubs, churches and nonprofits — manage members, events, finances and communications in one place. Self-host free under MIT or use affordable managed hosting via Sledgehammer Infosystems. Category head keyword cluster: group management software; open-source variant: open source group management software / self-hosted club management.

## Features (all at /features/)

- Members: one searchable roster for every person/team/role, relationships, dietary/shirt/custom fields, member self-serve edits, teams & hierarchy, managers & permissions, badges & titles (org charts on roadmap). Details: /features/members/ — primary term member management software.
- Events: team-scoped calendar, RSVPs, custom fields (hotel, t-shirts, transportation), shifts & check-in, time-clock kiosk PIN/barcode/RFID, multiple periods, bulk clock-out, birthdays. Roadmap: Google Calendar sync, requirements before check-in, attendance notifications. Details: /features/events/ — event management for teams/clubs.
- Finance: simple ledger with tagged transactions, receipts/invoice uploads, Stripe for cards/bank transfer (managed handles Stripe); Zeffy/PayPal/Venmo + bank-pull + fiscal sponsorship on roadmap. Tied to people/teams. Details: /features/finance/ — club bookkeeping software.
- Communication: team-scoped announcements with scheduled publish/expire, email digests + immediate push, content pages for handbooks; roadmap: text, Slack, Discord, unified notifications center, per-member channel prefs. Details: /features/communication/ — team announcement software.
- Automation & Reports: custom reports (code-snippet today, no-code builder on roadmap), period attendance, volunteer-hours; roadmap: Actions (user-triggered tasks) + Hooks (system-event automation). Details: /features/automation/ — volunteer hours tracking.

Hub page /features/ uses consistent card pattern (icon/screenshot+heading+1–2 sentence desc, no emoji/chip-list aesthetic per constraints), screenshots ss-calendar.png / ss-directory.png with width/height/lazy/alt.

## Self-Host vs Managed Hosting

| Dimension | Self-Host Free | Managed Hosting |
|---|---|---|
| License & cost | MIT — $0 + Stripe fees | Standard $50/mo · Custom $100/mo + plugins |
| Who runs server | You — full source/data | Sledgehammer — updates, backups |
| Payments | You wire Stripe yourself | Handled for you |
| Updates & support | Community + GitHub | Supported; Custom adds plugin dev |
| Best for | Technical teams wanting control | Teams wanting it to just work |
| FIRST discount | Self-host trivially free | Significant discount at cost |

Full table lives at /open-source/ and /hosting/. Aliases: /self-hosting → /open-source/, /pricing → /hosting/ (301 via /_redirects and meta-refresh canonicals). Philosophy at /hosting/: affordability as feature, First teams discounted significantly, quote for current tiers via /contact/. GitHub canonical is https://github.com/GatherPack/gatherpack (normalize casing).

## Who It's For — Use Cases

- FIRST Robotics (FRC/FTC): roster + shop kiosk + fundraising + competition logistics, team-scoped calendar, time-clock, dues via Stripe. Proof: Westside Robotics + Golden Gate Robotics. → /use-cases/first-robotics/ — primary term FIRST robotics team management software (replaces /first-teams, 301). Also covers FTC/FRC.
- Nonprofits: volunteer coordination, shifts, events, dues/donations, volunteer-hours for grants. → /use-cases/nonprofits/ — nonprofit membership management software.
- Churches: families/small groups, congregation roster, gatherings, giving/ledger alongside people. → /use-cases/churches/ — church management software.
- Youth Clubs: families incl. parent/child links, schedules, dues/receipts, privacy for minors via team scoping. → /use-cases/youth-clubs/ — youth club management software.
- Sports Leagues: divisions/teams/sub-teams, games/practices/shifts, registration fees, team announcements for rain-outs. → /use-cases/sports-leagues/ — sports league management software.

