## Metadata Contract & Layout

Per-page front matter: title ≤60ch keyword-front-loaded, description 120–155ch, optional graph_image (1200×630 cover) with width/height/alt, published_time/modified_time. Layout default.erb emits: <title>, meta description, og:title, og:description (=description), og:url (absolute_url), og:image (cover else logo.png) with width/height/alt, og:locale en_US, og:site_name GatherPack, twitter:card summary_large_image when cover, twitter:title/description/image/alt, canonical, meta robots where needed, article:published_time/modified_time, preconnect/dns-prefetch for plausible.io and kit.fontawesome.com, Google Fonts display=swap, theme-color #6d6753, JSON-LD partial. Single h1 per page, section ids, <main> <nav> <footer> <article> <time>. No JS-only content (Tally has fallback).

Site-wide JSON-LD (_json_ld.erb): Organization (name, url, logo, foundingDate 2014, sameAs from _social.erb, contactPoint), SoftwareApplication (BusinessApplication Web, offers free/MIT + two hosted offers, featureList, screenshot), BreadcrumbList on all sub-pages, FAQPage on /faq + per-page FAQPage for embedded 2–3 Qs, AboutPage + Person on /about, CollectionPage on /features /roadmap /updates, BlogPosting on update posts (supplements inline), WebPage for pillars/use-cases, ContactPage. Validated via validator.schema.org + Rich Results.

## GEO / Crawl Hygiene

- llms.txt at /llms.txt (this file's concise sibling) and /llms-full.txt (this file) — markdown plain, ~1500 tokens vs full, definition reused, audience, feature bullets, self-host vs hosted, links to all hubs + GitHub/Discord/contact, last updated date, reachable, comment pointer in robots.txt.
- robots.txt: User-agent * Allow /; explicit Allow for GPTBot ClaudeBot PerplexityBot Google-Extended anthropic-ai CCBot plus Sitemap and llms.txt comments; no AI crawler blocked; tester passes. Source: src/robots.txt.
- sitemap.xml: generated via bridgetown-sitemap, includes all 21 URLs, lastmod via front-matter last_modified_at || GitInspector git log -1 --pretty="format:%cI" || resource.date (not bare File.mtime), priority (1.0 for /, 0.8 hubs, 0.6 leaves) via sitemap_priority and changefreq via sitemap_change_frequency front matter. Valid XML.
- 404: branded src/404.erb permalink /404.html, noindex, robots noindex, sitemap false, includes nav/search/CTA, breadcrumbs suppressed, semantic landmarks retained. Aligns with AUDIT §7.
- Redirects: /first-teams → /use-cases/first-robotics/ 301, /self-hosting → /open-source/ 301, /pricing → /hosting/ 301 via src/_redirects (_redirects output) + meta-refresh HTML fallbacks at /first-teams/, /self-hosting/, /pricing/ with canonical + sitemap false/noindex. Documented in src/redirects.erb.
- Breadcrumbs: visible on every sub-page (Home > Features > Events) via _breadcrumbs.erb + BreadcrumbList JSON-LD from _json_ld.erb.
- Manifest: src/site.webmanifest name/short_name GatherPack, description = site description, theme_color/background_color #6d6753/#403a22, display standalone, keeps icons/display valid, theme-color meta synced.

